@startuml
title Fase 8 — Mesa visual por destinatario y propietario
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class GameManager
class ServerSession
class NetworkManager {
 View : SnapshotDto
 ViewChanged
 ConnectionChanged
}
class SnapshotDto {
 RecipientId / OwnHand
 Players / Melds
 DeckCount / DiscardTop / OfferedCard
 Phase / PaymentPlayerId
 RevealedHands
}
class Main <<Control>>
class Mesa <<Control>> {
 Bind(NetworkManager)
 DisplaySnapshot(view, status)
 RenderedPlayerCount
}
class Carta <<PanelContainer>> {
 ShowFace(id)
 ShowBack()
 ShowEmpty()
}
class CartaArtwork <<Control>> {
 ShowFace(suit, rank, ink)
 ShowBack()
 ShowEmpty()
}
class "Rivales / juegos rivales" as RivalZones <<Containers>>
class "Centro: mazo / pozo / oferta" as Center <<Containers>>
class "Mi juego / bandeja / mano" as OwnZones <<Containers>>
class Card
ServerSession *-- GameManager
NetworkManager --> ServerSession : solo host
NetworkManager --> SnapshotDto : vista autorizada
Main *-- NetworkManager : ruta persistente
Main *-- Mesa
Mesa --> NetworkManager : leer View / salir
Mesa *-- RivalZones : SeatIndex / OwnerId
Mesa *-- Center
Mesa *-- OwnZones : RecipientId / OwnHand
RivalZones *-- Carta : solo Melds públicos
Center *-- Carta : dorso / pozo / oferta
OwnZones *-- Carta : cartas autorizadas
Carta *-- CartaArtwork
Carta --> Card : identidad visual
note right of CartaArtwork
Arte local original.
Dorso/vacío borran rango y palo.
Sin lógica de reglas.
end note
note right of Mesa
Avatares de iniciales: sin nuevos DTO.
No actions de cartas / RPC / motor local.
Manos rivales solo en revelación autorizada.
end note
@enduml
